  "name": "CoFaithfulQA",
  "description": "CoFaithfulQA evaluates whether a question-answering model adopts an accurate passage when its answer from memory disagrees. Each record set preserves one of the six source QA datasets and its original JSON Lines file. A record includes the original question, passage, accepted answers, a closed-book model answer and its frequency. The public files contain 8,529 rows before deduplication.",
